Distinct-name lexicographic unrank-ന്റെ ആദ്യ രണ്ടു canonicalIndex തിരഞ്ഞെടുപ്പുകളും residual rank-ഉം പരിശോധിക്കുന്ന clean Stage 1 പരിശോധന.

Hamlet, remaining master-name count n സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, തിരഞ്ഞെടുക്കേണ്ട മൊത്തം പേരുകളുടെ എണ്ണം k സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, one-based rank സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, ആദ്യ block size സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, രണ്ടാം block size സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, loop factor സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, loop count സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Cordelia, ആദ്യ original candidate ordinal സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Portia, ആദ്യ residual rank സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Viola, രണ്ടാം remaining-list ordinal സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Miranda, രണ്ടാം original candidate ordinal സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ariel, രണ്ടാം residual rank സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Prospero, input-output സഹായിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: രണ്ട് falling-factorial block-ുകൾ നിർമ്മിക്കുന്നു.

Scene I: n, k, rank വായിക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Prospero and Hamlet]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Juliet]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Romeo]
Prospero:
 Listen to your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: ആദ്യ block P(n-1,k-1) ആരംഭിക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Prospero and Othello]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Hamlet and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Juliet and a hero.

Scene III: ആദ്യ falling factorial loop.
Prospero:
 Are you better than nothing?
 If not, let us proceed to scene IV.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Lady Macbeth and Othello]
Lady Macbeth:
 You are as good as the product of Othello and myself.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 Let us return to scene III.

Scene IV: ആദ്യ candidate, residual rank.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Portia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Romeo and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Romeo and a hero.
 You are as good as the quotient between yourself and Othello.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: രണ്ടാം block P(n-2,k-2) ആരംഭിക്കുന്നു.
[Enter Prospero and Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Hamlet and a big hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Juliet and a big hero.

Scene VI: രണ്ടാം falling factorial loop.
Prospero:
 Are you better than nothing?
 If not, let us proceed to scene VII.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Lady Macbeth and Macbeth]
Lady Macbeth:
 You are as good as the product of Macbeth and myself.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Lady Macbeth]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ophelia]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between yourself and a hero.
 Let us return to scene VI.

Scene VII: രണ്ടാം remaining ordinal, residual rank.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ariel]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Portia and a hero.
 You are as good as the remainder of the quotient between yourself and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Viola]
Prospero:
 You are as good as the difference between Portia and a hero.
 You are as good as the quotient between yourself and Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.

Scene VIII: ആദ്യ തിരഞ്ഞെടുപ്പ് നീക്കിയ original list-ിലേക്ക് രണ്ടാം ordinal മാപ്പ് ചെയ്യുന്നു.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Viola]
Prospero:
 Are you worse than Cordelia?
 If so, let us proceed to scene IX.
 Let us proceed to scene X.

Scene IX: രണ്ടാം original ordinal unchanged.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Viola and Miranda]
Viola:
 You are as good as myself.
 Let us proceed to scene XI.

Scene X: ആദ്യ ordinal കടന്നാൽ original ordinal ഒന്നുകൂടി.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Viola and Miranda]
Viola:
 You are as good as the sum of myself and a hero.

Scene XI: മൂന്ന് outputs പുറത്തിടുന്നു.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Cordelia]
Prospero:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Miranda]
Prospero:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Prospero and Ariel]
Prospero:
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
